  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Humanitarian Assistance in Protracted Crisis in Kachin, Northern Shan and Rakhine State through UNOPS platform</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The provision of food, cash support, essential WASH support, non-food items and emergency response in Kachin and Rakhine requires to be continued through the locally-led response.  UK will provide &#xa3; 15 million in this FY 22/23 to reach more than 200,000 IPDs (including Rohingya) through 4 local partners and 3 INGOs managed by UNOPS.</narrative>
  </description>
